※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4281 LANG_KIND_ASKED_OUTSIDE_COMPTIME

※ What kind a type is, is settled while compiling, so `⎕kindof` is compared with a
※ literal in a condition `comptime` was written on and stands nowhere else.

let std := ⎕import("std")

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    let said: str = ⎕kindof(⌜u8⌝)
    if said = "integer": 0u6 else: 1u6
